{"blocks":[["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4115","Modulation matrix",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4139","Amounts use the signed normalized range −1…+1. Microfreak/UG/05 Connections/02 Matrix and Encoder/01 Sources and Destinations",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4330","Cycling Envelope → Pitch: +0.004.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4429","PRESSURE → Wave: +0.170.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4541","ENV → Timbre: +0.968.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4666","PRESSURE → Timbre: +0.486.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4782","ENV → Cutoff: +0.328.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-4931","PRESSURE → Cutoff: +0.187.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5071","LFO → Assign 1 → Noise: +0.203.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5274","PRESSURE → Assign 2 → Noise: −0.125.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5475","All other saved matrix amounts are zero.",["Notes","Modulation matrix"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5520","Voice and keyboard",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5545","Paraphonic mode: on.",["Notes","Voice and keyboard"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5629","Performance and session context",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5667","Held notes swell in slowly. The main envelope adds Fold (+0.968) and opens the cutoff (+0.328) as each note opens. Key pressure adds Saturate (+0.170), Fold (+0.486) and cutoff (+0.187) and lowers Noise through Assign 2 (−0.125); the synced sawtooth LFO adds Noise through Assign 1 (+0.203).",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-5965","The PRESSURE matrix row follows the instrument's global expression setting, which the export does not record.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/259%20Infini%20Pad/","source-block-6079","Turning Shape up raises Noise and makes the pad work as a noisy bass in the low register, as heard from 05:15 in GitP/A/Session/26/11/01-Sun.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]]],"format_version":5}